<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Tax Exemption Certificate</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3 { margin-top: 0; }
        .header-info { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .section-title { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .form-row { display: flex; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .form-row > div { flex: 1; padding-right: 20px; }
        .form-row > div:nth-child(even) { padding-right: 0; }
        .label { font-weight: bold; display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; }
        .input-area { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; min-height: 20px; }
        .signature-block { margin-top: 50px; }
        .signature-line { border-top: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 50px; padding-top: 5px; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 20px; }
        td { padding: 8px 0; text-align: left; }
        .center-text { text-align: center; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <div class="header-info">
            <div>
                <h1>H-3GOV</h1>
                <p>City of Columbus, Income Tax Division</p>
            </div>
            <div class="center-text">
                <p>STEC B</p>
                <p>Rev. 3/15</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <h2 style="text-align: center;">Hotel/Motel Excise Tax Exemption Certificate</h2>
        <p style="text-align: center;">(To be completed by guest and submitted to registration)</p>

        <!-- Part A -->
        <div class="section-title">Part A OCCUPANT INFORMATION</div>
        <div class="form-row">
            <div>
                <span class="label">1. Occupant's Name</span>
                <div class="input-area"><span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span></div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="label">2. Title</span>
                <div class="input-area"><span data-field="title">{{ title }}</span></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Part B -->
        <div class="section-title">Part B BUSINESS OR INSTITUTION AUTHORIZATION</div>
        <div class="form-row">
            <div>
                <span class="label">1. Name of Business or Institution Claiming Exemption</span>
                <div class="input-area"><span data-field="employer.name">{{ employer.name }}</span></div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="label">2. Federal ID No.</span>
                <div class="input-area"><span data-field="employer.federal_id">{{ employer.federal_id }}</span></div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="label">3. Telephone No.</span>
                <div class="input-area"><span data-field="employer.phone">{{ employer.phone }}</span></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Part C -->
        <div class="section-title">Part C HOTEL INFORMATION</div>
        <div class="form-row">
            <div>
                <span class="label">1. Name of Hotel, Apartment Hotel or Lodging House</span>
                <div class="input-area"><span data-field="hotel.name">{{ hotel.name }}</span></div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="label">2. Arrival Date</span>
                <div class="input-area"><span data-field="hotel.arrival_date">{{ hotel.arrival_date }}</span></div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="label">3. Departure Date</span>
                <div class="input-area"><span data-field="hotel.departure_date">{{ hotel.departure_date }}</span></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-row">
            <div>
                <span class="label">4. Hotel Address:</span>
                <div class="input-area"><span data-field="hotel.address">{{ hotel.address }}</span></div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="label">5. Prepared by (Name of Hotel Employee)</span>
                <div class="input-area"><span data-field="hotel.prepared_by">{{ hotel.prepared_by }}</span></div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="label">6. Hotel Vendors License No.</span>
                <div class="input-area"><span data-field="hotel.license_number">{{ hotel.license_number }}</span></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- State and Local Governments Section -->
        <div class="section-title">STATE AND LOCAL GOVERNMENTS AND POLITICAL SUBDIVISIONS THEREOF</div>
        <p>I certify that the hotel accommodation purchased is to be paid directly with funds from the entity noted on this form and will be used in the exercise of that entity's essential functions. "Directly" does not include per diem, entity advances, or similar indirect payments.</p>

        <!-- United States Governmental Exemption -->
        <div class="section-title">UNITED STATES GOVERNMENTAL EXEMPTION</div>
        <p>I certify that the hotel accommodation purchased is to be paid directly with funds from the entity noted on this form and will be used in the exercise of that entity's essential functions. Caution: "Directly" does not include per diem, entity advances, or personal credit card are subject to tax. This is true even if the employees will be reimbursed by the federal government. Fill in the GSA centrally billed credit card type, prefix and sixth digit:</p>
        <div class="form-row">
            <div style="flex: 1;">
                <span class="label">PLATFORM (Visa and etc.)</span>
                <div class="input-area"><span data-field="gsa.platform">{{ gsa.platform }}</span></div>
            </div>
            <div style="flex: 1;">
                <span class="label">PREFIX (First four digits)</span>
                <div class="input-area"><span data-field="gsa.prefix">{{ gsa.prefix }}</span></div>
            </div>
            <div style="flex: 1;">
                <span class="label">SIXTH DIGIT</span>
                <div class="input-area"><span data-field="gsa.sixth_digit">{{ gsa.sixth_digit }}</span></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Declaration -->
        <div class="section-title">NOTE TO VENDOR</div>
        <p>To be valid this certificate must be filled out completely. Transaction to be reported and exemption claimed at conclusion of guest occupancy. Do not send this certification to the Columbus Income Tax Division. Keep a copy of this certificate for your records since it must be available for audit review.</p>

        <div class="section-title">NOTE TO TRANSIENT GUESTS</div>
        <p>This certificate must be completed prior to and submitted at the time of registration. Legible faded or scanned exemption certificates received by the vendor from qualifying businesses or institutions will be accepted. Multiple guests from the same entity may submit separate certificates for each individual occupant. All occupants must be listed in Part A. Do not send this certification to the Columbus Income Tax Division. KEEP A COPY OF THIS CERTIFICATION FOR YOUR RECORDS. You are responsible to notify the vendor of cancellation, modification, or limitation of the exemption you have claimed.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <!-- Second Page Content (Based on second image) -->
        <div class="header-info">
            <div>
                <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" style="height: 50px;">
                <p>Department of Taxation</p>
            </div>
            <div class="center-text">
                <p>Sales and Use Tax</p>
                <p>Blanket Exemption Certificate</p>
            </div>
            <div class="center-text" style="align-self: flex-end;">
                <p>STEC B</p>
                <p>Rev. 3/15</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <p>The purchaser hereby claims exemption or exemption on all purchases of tangible personal property and selected services made under this certificate from:</p>
        <div class="form-row">
            <div style="flex: 1;">
                <span class="label">(Vendor's name)</span>
                <div class="input-area"><span data-field="vendor.name">{{ vendor.name }}</span></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <p>and certifies that the claim is based upon the purchaser's proposed use of the items or services, the activity of the purchase, or both, as shown herein:</p>

        <p>This sale is exempt under Ohio law, pursuant to Ohio Revised Code Section 5739.02(B)(1), as a sale to the State of Ohio or any of its political subdivisions. Purchases of the Telecommunication Services are exempt as defined by Ohio Revised Code Section 5739.01(B)(3)(F) and 5739.01(AA).</p>
        <p>This certificate shall continue in force until revoked. It shall be considered a part of each order given the above-named vendor unless otherwise specified.</p>

        <div class="section-title">Purchaser must state a valid reason for claiming exemption or exemption.</div>

        <!-- Purchaser Information -->
        <div class="form-row">
            <div>
                <span class="label">Purchaser's name</span>
                <div class="input-area"><span data-field="purchaser.name">{{ purchaser.name }}</span></div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="label">Purchaser's address</span>
                <div class="input-area"><span data-field="purchaser.address">{{ purchaser.address }}</span></div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="label">Purchaser's type of business</span>
                <div class="input-area"><span data-field="purchaser.business_type">{{ purchaser.business_type }}</span></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-row">
            <div>
                <span class="label">Street address</span>
                <div class="input-area"><span data-field="purchaser.street_address">{{ purchaser.street_address }}</span></div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="label">City, State, Zip</span>
                <div class="input-area"><span data-field="purchaser.city_state_zip">{{ purchaser.city_state_zip }}</span></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Signature Block -->
        <div class="signature-block">
            <div class="form-row" style="justify-content: space-between;">
                <div>
                    <div class="signature-line"></div>
                    <div class="center-text" style="margin-top: 5px;"><span data-field="purchaser.signature">{{ purchaser.signature }}</span></div>
                    <div class="center-text" style="margin-top: 5px;"><span data-field="purchaser.title">{{ purchaser.title }}</span></div>
                </div>
                <div style="text-align: right;">
                    <div class="signature-line"></div>
                    <div class="center-text" style="margin-top: 5px;">Interim Director, Procurement Services</div>
                    <div class="center-text" style="margin-top: 5px;">Title</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tax ID Information -->
        <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 40px;">
            <div style="flex: 1;">
                <span class="label">Date signed</span>
                <div class="input-area"><span data-field="tax_id.date_signed">{{ tax_id.date_signed }}</span></div>
            </div>
            <div style="flex: 1;">
                <span class="label">Vendor's license number, if any</span>
                <div class="input-area"><span data-field="tax_id.license_number">{{ tax_id.license_number }}</span></div>
            </div>
            <div style="flex: 1;">
                <span class="label">Federal Tax ID Number:</span>
                <div class="input-area"><span data-field="tax_id.federal_id">{{ tax_id.federal_id }}</span></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Vendor Notes -->
        <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 50px;">Vendor Notes</div>
        <p>Vendors of motor vehicles, titled watercraft and titled outboard motors may use this certificate to purchase these items under the "resale" exemption. Otherwise, purchaser must comply with either rule 5703-9-10 or 5703-9-25 of the Administrative Code. This certificate cannot be used by construction contractors to purchase material for incorporation into real property under an exempt construction contract. Construction contractors must comply with rule 5703-9-14 of the Administrative Code.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>